OL,3,AApple's new boss starts with big gamble
OL,4,Aon #1,999 first folding iPhone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new boss of Apple has marked his
OL,7,Ffirst public appearance by launching
OL,8,Fthe company's most expensive iPhone - a
OL,9,Ffoldable handheld that costs at least
OL,10,F#1,999.
OL,12,FJohn Ternus, who took over from
OL,13,Flong-time chief executive Tim Cook this
OL,14,Fmonth, unveiled the iPhone Duo, which
OL,15,Fis the first major design change to the
OL,16,FiPhone for nearly two decades.
OL,18,FApple is entering the foldable phone
OL,19,Fmarket comparatively late, following
OL,20,Fthe likes of South Korea's Samsung and
OL,21,FChina's Huawei.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
